{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的S08只有20秒，却连续出现多组未标时点的感受短句，实际扫读压力明显高于X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键落点，感受又按音乐实际进程分批出现，观众可以先抓住人物在经历什么，再随着音乐接收细腻的声音和心理变化；反复出现的旧歌、舞步、摇篮曲等线索也让前后更像同一段经历。X的优势是人物自我说服、犹疑和选择的因果解释更充分，尤其部分段落把为什么难受、为什么不回头说得更完整，但右侧感受词容易形成同时铺开的信息堆，音乐与文字的对应也不如Y精确。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f0c8dcd-97f1-487a-af1b-5e85465432da", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T232207259917Z", "elapsed_seconds": 36.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:22:44.097157+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6643667ee48d526032c6c5b868536b6a81680bc4c80b32fcbac351560b74a84", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme